{"id": "EUVD-2026-103293", "enisaUuid": "6babc282-d77d-30e7-b006-48cd048db6c4", "description": "Coder from 2.10.0 before 2.34.8 has an unauthenticated agent debug HTTP server on 127.0.0.1:2113 whose /debug/manifest handler returns the full agent manifest, including template-provided environment variable values. A lower-privileged Unix user or process in the same workspace can query this endpoint to read credentials such as cloud keys or registry tokens.", "datePublished": "2026-10-17T18:46:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T11:42:56", "baseScore": 4.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/coder/coder/security/advisories/GHSA-73wg-wxvv-9r4j", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/coder-from-2.10.0-before-2.34.8-information-disclosure-via-agent-debug-manifest"], "aliases": ["GHSA-3gj5-9m6g-289w", "CVE-2026-111926"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.1, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6893679f-975d-3abb-9e91-4084a10fe4a0", "product": {"name": "coder", "vendor": {"name": "coder"}}, "product_version": "2.10.0 <2.34.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "27b3b242-2e59-3df3-bfd0-21387eb3f7e6", "vendor": {"name": "coder"}}], "isExploited": false}